There was a question about untrapping traps and an answer is that you can untrap
any floor trap by simply stepping on it or levitating over it and digging a pit
or hole with your pickaxe or wand of digging.

The pit or trapdoor is of course easily to untrap with a boulder.

And yes, this won't work on levels where the floor is to hard to dig into.

By the way, I discovered this once when I applied a drum of eartquake in Fort
Ludios and destroyed the magic portal, the only way out. Very annoying.

